# GitHub's language statistics count every tracked file, so a checked-in
# third-party bundle is reported as if we wrote it. Swagger UI and the jQuery
# plugins ship here as vendored bundles: 5.3 MB of the 5.33 MB of JavaScript in
# this repository is theirs, which had GitHub calling a Python project 46%
# JavaScript. Marking them linguist-vendored leaves them in the tree and in the
# diff, and only takes them out of the language breakdown.
#
# Ours, and deliberately still counted: api/static/js/dis.js,
# api/static/js/tablesorter.js, api/static/css/main.css,
# api/static/css/tablesorter-jrc1.css.

api/static/swagger-ui/**                linguist-vendored
api/static/swagger-ui5/**               linguist-vendored
api/static/js/jquery/**                 linguist-vendored
api/static/js/bootstrap-autocomplete/** linguist-vendored
